//
//  Nodes 1, stage 2: the node maps of the GameState and the node RPCs (protocol/repl/node_rpc.h) against what the retail server sent
//  (tests/capture_blocks.h kGameStateFastMaps28 = capture 1198's login; tests/capture_nodes.h, generated by tools/capture/gen_node_state.py: capture 1198's 49 node
//  summaries, 49 idle siege summaries and the cooldown answer, and the maps of the server hops of capture 623).
//
//    * the maps: the four GameState arrays of the login and of both hops read to their last bit, typed, brought to the typed state by sync_node_maps and written back
//      to the exact bits of the capture; a sync of the same maps changes nothing; a changed level is one change, a new node an add, a gone node a remove
//    * the summaries: all 49 read to their last bit, typed, written back (the members the typed form holds) to the exact bits for every node whose summary holds nothing
//      else (no skill points, relics or wars); the plots, the layout and the levels are what the typed form says
//    * the idle siege summaries: all 46 are rebuilt from the node and its name to the exact bits (the organisation's guid is the node's guid in its last two words)
//    * the cooldown answer is one 0 bit
//    * the requests and the GM console parameters parse; the defaults do not hide
// ============================================================================
